# XPON Project Structure & Build Guide

Vecima XGS-PON Yocto workspace. Application C/C++ work lives in **externalsrc** under `build-xpon/workspace/sources/`.

## Paths

| Item | Path |
|------|------|
| Project root | `~/works/repo` |
| Externalsrc | `~/works/repo/build-xpon/workspace/sources/` |
| bbappend overrides | `~/works/repo/build-xpon/workspace/appends/` |
| Build dir (after `. setup-env`) | `~/works/repo/build-xpon/` |

## Recipe ↔ source map

| Recipe | Source tree | Key output / role |
|--------|-------------|-------------------|
| `netconf-polt` | `sources/netconf-polt` | `bcmolt_netconf_server`; TR-383/385/451 NETCONF; ONU mgmt; vOMCI |
| `xpon-apps` | `sources/xpon-apps` | protocol-handler, node-mgr, event-monitor, metrics-mgr, logsvr, swmgr, … |
| `xpon-libs` | `sources/xpon-libs` | ipc, redis, log, timer, taskman, utils, dpl |
| `xpon-protos` | `sources/xpon-protos` | gRPC/protobuf stubs (`proto/`) |
| `xpon-yang` | `sources/xpon-yang` | YANG models (bbf, ietf, exs1610) |
| `sw-bcm686olt` | `sources/sw-bcm686olt/release` | Broadcom BAL SDK（只读） |
| `libyang` | `sources/libyang` | YANG parser（只读） |
| `sysrepo` | `sources/sysrepo` | YANG datastore（只读） |

bbappend files in `workspace/appends/` set `EXTERNALSRC:pn-<recipe>`.

## Build commands

```bash
cd ~/works/repo && . setup-env    # lands in build-xpon/
bitbake <recipe> -c compile -f    # force recompile after externalsrc edits
bitbake <recipe>
bitbake xpon-olt-bundle           # full RAUC release bundle
```

`MACHINE` typically `exs1610`, `DISTRO` `xpon` (`build-xpon/conf/local.conf`).

**IDE:** after bitbake, from `workspace/sources/`: `./setup-compile-commands.sh`; open `xpon-externalsrc.code-workspace`.

## Feature → repo quick map

| Feature area | Primary repo(s) |
|--------------|-----------------|
| NETCONF / YANG RPC | `netconf-polt`, `xpon-yang` |
| ONU / OMCI / vOMCI | `netconf-polt/onu_mgmt`, `xpon-protos` |
| OLT chip / BAL | read `sw-bcm686olt`; implement in `netconf-polt/balapi` |
| DHCP/PPPoE/protocol | `xpon-apps/protocol-handler` |
| System mgmt / events / metrics | `xpon-apps` |
| Shared infra | `xpon-libs` |
| gRPC / protobuf | `xpon-protos` |
| YANG model only | `xpon-yang` |
| sysrepo/libyang usage | `netconf-polt` (integration) |

## Repo subdirs (key areas)

**netconf-polt:** `netconf_server/modules/bbf-xpon/` (YANG handlers), `onu_mgmt/`, `balapi/`, `daemon/`

**xpon-apps:** `protocol-handler/`, `node-mgr/`, `event-monitor/`, `metrics-mgr/`, `logsvr/`, `swmgr/`, `callhome/`, `notif-mgr/`

**xpon-libs:** `ipc/`, `redis/`, `log/`, `timer/`, `taskman/`, `utils/`, `dpl/`, `debug/` (DbgCli API: `debug/include/dbg.h`)

## Tech stack

C/C++ (CMake), NETCONF/YANG (TR-383/385/WT-451), gRPC (vOMCI), Redis, Broadcom OLT/BAL API.
